 codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1019310/extras/1f98298403c99135f051b7d771b5c2c9.mp4?t=1635861345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Travelling around the world, he'll have to deal with hardware graveyards, digital archeology, tribes of cryptoshamans, and virtual reality debauchery.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1019310/extras/d0d70ea1a1f191090f11d8de8c466402.poster.avif?t=1635861345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1019310/extras/d0d70ea1a1f191090f11d8de8c466402.webm?t=1635861345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1019310/extras/d0d70ea1a1f191090f11d8de8c466402.mp4?t=1635861345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
